genlight - SNP #2: 1,1,2,0 --> heterozygous,  heterozygous, homozygous for the SNP allele, homozygous for the Reference allele
.geno - SNP #2: 1,1,2,0 -->  heterozygous,  heterozygous, homozygous for the Reference allele, homozygous for the SNP allele
